---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Protecting Your Health Data | MiKare Health" description="MiKare Health Privacy Policy. Learn how MIKARE HEALTH PTY LTD collects, uses, stores, and protects your personal and health data. Your privacy is our priority.">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h1 class="page-header__title animate-fade-in-up">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-header__subtitle animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.15s;">
        Last updated: 2 March 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Privacy Policy Content -->
  <section class="section" style="background: var(--bg-secondary); padding-top: var(--space-16);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p><strong>MIKARE HEALTH PTY LTD</strong> ("MiKare", "we", "us", "our") is committed to protecting your privacy and handling your personal information in a lawful, transparent and secure manner.</p>
        <p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, store and protect your personal data when you access or use the MiKare mobile application (available on iOS and Android), our website (mikare.health), and any related services.</p>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p>MiKare is a health and wellness mobile application developed by MIKARE HEALTH PTY LTD, a company registered in Australia.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Company:</strong> MIKARE HEALTH PTY LTD</li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> 81–83 Campbell Street, Surry Hills NSW 2010, Australia</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@mikare.health">support@mikare.health</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p><strong>Account Information</strong></p>
        <p>When you create an account, we collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Password (stored in encrypted form)</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Health and Wellness Data</strong></p>
        <p>When you use the app, you may choose to provide:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Health notes and records</li>
          <li>Medical documents</li>
          <li>Symptoms and care information</li>
          <li>Wellness tracking data</li>
          <li>Activity and lifestyle information</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Subscription and Payment Information</strong></p>
        <p>If you subscribe to premium features, we may collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Subscription plan details</li>
          <li>Payment transaction records</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Payment processing is handled by Apple (App Store) and Google (Google Play). MiKare does not store complete credit card or payment card information.</p>

        <p><strong>Automatically Collected Information</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Device type and operating system</li>
          <li>App usage and activity data</li>
          <li>Diagnostics and error logs</li>
          <li>IP address</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <p>We use your information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide and maintain the MiKare app and its features</li>
          <li>Authenticate your account via username and password</li>
          <li>Process subscriptions and payments</li>
          <li>Respond to support requests</li>
          <li>Improve app performance and user experience</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">4. How We Protect Your Data</h2>
        <p>Your data security is a priority. We implement the following measures:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Encryption in transit:</strong> All data transmitted between the app and our servers is encrypted using industry-standard TLS/SSL protocols</li>
          <li><strong>Access controls:</strong> Access to personal data is restricted to authorised personnel only</li>
          <li><strong>Secure infrastructure:</strong> We use reputable cloud hosting providers with robust security certifications</li>
          <li><strong>Monitoring:</strong> We monitor our systems for potential security threats</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">5. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal data. We do <strong>not</strong> use your health data for advertising.</p>
        <p>We may share limited information with:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Hosting providers:</strong> To store and serve your data securely</li>
          <li><strong>Payment processors:</strong> To process subscription payments (via Apple and Google)</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics providers:</strong> To understand app usage in aggregate (de-identified data only)</li>
          <li><strong>Legal authorities:</strong> When required by law or to protect our rights</li>
        </ul>
        <p>All third-party providers are contractually required to protect your data and only process it as instructed.</p>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain your data for as long as your account is active. Specific retention periods include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Account information:</strong> Retained while your account is active, plus up to 90 days after deletion</li>
          <li><strong>Health data:</strong> Retained while your account is active, plus up to 90 days after deletion</li>
          <li><strong>Support communications:</strong> Up to 12 months</li>
          <li><strong>Legal records:</strong> As required by applicable law</li>
        </ul>
        <p>After the applicable retention period, data is securely deleted or anonymised.</p>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access</strong> the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li><strong>Correct</strong> inaccurate or incomplete data</li>
          <li><strong>Delete</strong> your account and associated data</li>
          <li><strong>Export</strong> your data in a portable format</li>
          <li><strong>Withdraw consent</strong> for data processing at any time</li>
          <li><strong>Object</strong> to processing based on legitimate interests</li>
          <li><strong>Lodge a complaint</strong> with a relevant data protection authority</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:support@mikare.health">support@mikare.health</a>. Requests are handled within 30 days.</p>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">8. Account and Data Deletion</h2>
        <p>You may request deletion of your account and data at any time by:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Using the in-app account deletion feature</li>
          <li>Visiting our <a href="/delete-account">Account Deletion</a> page</li>
          <li>Emailing <a href="mailto:support@mikare.health">support@mikare.health</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p>Upon deletion, your personal information, health data, and preferences will be removed. Some data may be retained for up to 90 days to comply with legal and regulatory obligations.</p>
        <p>You may also request deletion of specific data types without deleting your account via our <a href="/delete-data">Data Deletion</a> page.</p>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">9. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>MiKare does not knowingly collect personal data from children under 16 without verifiable parental consent. If we become aware that we have collected data from a child under 16, we will take steps to delete that information.</p>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The current version will always be available on our website. We will notify you of material changes through the app or via email.</p>

        <h2 class="prose__heading">11. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled, please contact us:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@mikare.health">support@mikare.health</a></li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> MIKARE HEALTH PTY LTD, 81–83 Campbell Street, Surry Hills NSW 2010, Australia</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
